      "sourceTextSha256": "0b8efc7fd7dbd2aaf3e02dd099a3e48819f5c9125b6aa17affce5ee3f39d0126",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-d1461c91bf6a",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, head out on a boat trip with stops at some of the island’s best beaches. The boat crosses the bay past small islands and green hillsides, and the water changes from deep blue to emerald green. You may spot dolphins, large fish and turtles along the way.\n\nThe schooner stops for swimming. The trip is unguided, with plenty of time by the water, so the day is devoted entirely to the sea and the island’s coast. After the busier city sightseeing of the previous days, the focus here is on bays, green islets and stops out on the water."
    },
